            "a leak on top of either hosted series is rejected",
            "the leak the medians catch: 158 and 113 bytes a round on the hosted series, 137 on a heap with no noise",
            "the limit is the GF-30 limit and it is inclusive",
            "a transient in the last round is not growth",
            "an odd number of steady rounds leaves the one between the halves out, and an even one takes the lower median",
